      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/ba8739/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-02-21T01:11:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm so scared of it stinking, to be honest. It's a difficult title to translate to the screen, in my opinion, even if it is great.</p><p>While the setting is great for film - making a walking tree and a gun-racoon cool on screen just strikes me as harder than making the Avengers work. Treebeard not withstanding.<br><br>I want it to be great. Not Ant Man great, but still great.<br><br>How about a Runaways tv miniseries?</p>",
